<title>POLAND: SOCCER-LEGIA WIN POLISH SUPERCUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEGIA WIN POLISH SUPERCUP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legia Warszawa won Polish soccer's</p>
<p>Supercup on Sunday by beating Widzew Lodz 2-1 (halftime 1-1).</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Legia - Kenneth Zeigbo 45, Tomasz Sokolowski 79</p>
<p>Widzew - Jacek Dembinski 37.</p>
</text>
